    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gangs rule the streets. The cops have lost control.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from nothing, build your crew, and take over the city in <strong>Ganglands</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734080/extras/fdb0bd41cf03d01a2cb8df018688563a.avif?t=1752429043\" width=616 height=52 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734080/extras/64d69f03200327454a7276ae9e1750da.poster.avif?t=1752429043\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734080/extras/64d69f03200327454a7276ae9e1750da.webm?t=1752429043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734080/extras/64d69f03200327454a7276ae9e1750da.mp4?t=1752429043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plan the heist. Smash your way in. Fight your way out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rob banks with your gang while battling rival crews and tight security.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734080/extras/5b631721d9350eff4889a216280bace6.avif?t=1752429043\" width=616 height=52 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734080/extras/f83b93d1388beee00c7fcda3658e1de7.poster.avif?t=1752429043\" width=426 height=2